# CI self-heal push

Follow [`.cursor/skills/github-aramex-ci-self-heal/SKILL.md`](../skills/github-aramex-ci-self-heal/SKILL.md).

- Stage all changes, then pull from `github`, resolve conflicts, and push.
- Push only to `https://github.com/aditis1017/Aramex.git`.
- Re-execute a failed Aramex CI run through GitHub Actions.
- Stop after 3 pipeline runs. Do not start a 4th.
